    "category": "Characters",
    "body": "Lady Virelle Caith is a striking Fae noblewoman with pale golden skin, long dark auburn hair, and cool blue-gray eyes. She is tall, elegant, and beautifully composed, with refined features, a graceful figure, and the polished confidence of someone born into court life. Virelle favors rich jewel-toned gowns, fitted silks, delicate gold jewelry, and subtle glamour, always appearing immaculate without looking overdone. Her beauty is sophisticated rather than delicate—warm at first glance, sharper the longer one looks.\n\nVirelle has been Rhaevor Veyr’s long-standing mistress, an arrangement known quietly throughout Veyrhold and among the upper court. She is not his consort and holds no formal claim to his title or succession, but years of familiarity have given her a recognized place in his private life. She knows his habits, has access to certain personal spaces, and is accustomed to being treated as someone who belongs near the High Lord, even if that place has never been officially promised to her. centuries old but appears 36 years old",
