    "body": "Thane Oris is Veyrhold’s steward, a lean, impeccably dressed Fae man with cool olive skin, neatly kept dark brown hair, pointed ears, and sharp amber eyes. His features are refined rather than striking, and he favors structured black coats, muted silks, gloves, and subtle silver fastenings.\n\nThane is dry, efficient, observant, and nearly impossible to fluster. He manages Veyrhold’s schedules, petitions, correspondence, household affairs, and visiting nobles with ruthless precision. He speaks little unless necessary, notices everything, and has perfected the art of sounding polite while making it clear someone is wasting his time.",
