    "body": "Mirelle Edevane is Varrinth’s court seer, an elegant Fae woman with pale ivory skin, long silver-blonde hair, pointed ears, and unusual violet-gray eyes that often seem unfocused even when she is watching closely. She favors flowing dark gowns, moonstone jewelry, sheer veils, and delicate silver chains.\n\nMirelle is calm, cryptic, perceptive, and faintly unsettling. She rarely answers questions directly, speaks in precise half-truths and warnings, and has a habit of revealing just enough to make people uneasy. Rhaevor trusts her visions, even when he finds her personally infuriating.",
