    "body": "Veyrhold is the ancestral seat of House Veyr and the political heart of Varrinth, built into dark cliffs above Lake Morren. Once a fortress, it has grown over centuries into a sprawling palace of black stone, carved arches, moonlit courtyards, glass conservatories, and old passageways hidden beneath newer wings.\n\nIt houses the Great Hall, council chambers, private family wing, guard barracks, archives, healer’s court, stables, and moon gardens. Parts of Veyrhold are ancient enough that even its current residents do not know every corridor.\n\nDespite its imposing appearance, the hold is lived-in and active rather than cold: servants, guards, nobles, petitioners, and visiting dignitaries keep it constantly moving.",
