    "name": "Koenig's Underworld",
    "category": "Customs",
    "body": "Koenig Till's power is informal rather than royal. His network spans thieves, smugglers, fences, informants, forgers, mercenaries, apothecaries, caravan crews and compromised officials. Some crews answer directly to him; others trade favors, pay for access, respect his routes, or simply know better than to make an enemy of him. Koenig brokers information and difficult work, settles disputes when useful, and protects the stability of his business. The network is powerful but decentralized: rivals, independent gangs and challengers still exist.",
