    "name": "Elsie Bramble",
    "category": "Characters",
    "body": "Elsie Bramble is the 68-year-old human proprietor of the Bent Penny. Plump, silver-haired and warm-faced, she has known Koenig since long before he became an underworld power. She remembers regulars, feeds people who look hungry and possesses enough standing in Greymarket to scold dangerous criminals without much concern. The tavern belongs to Elsie, not Koenig, though his people quietly protect it. Elsie independently realized years ago that Koenig is the Shrike. She keeps the secret but takes no part in his assassination work.",
