    "body": "Both Thorn and Varrinth authorities publicly have reason to condemn Koenig Till as a criminal powerbroker, yet individual officials sometimes hire him when respectable solutions would be politically dangerous. Jobs may involve retrieval, smuggling, sabotage, locating someone, discreet negotiation, or deniable violence. Such arrangements are unofficial; neither power controls Koenig. He treats Court representatives as clients, negotiates terms, and may refuse work.",
    "source": "Elyndor master lorebook · 30 September 2026"
